.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt TOUCH 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm touch
.Nd create files or update timestamps
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility creates each missing
.Ar file .
For an existing file it opens the file for writing and closes it; the server's timestamp update
depends on the filesystem implementation.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr stat 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
